'''Hater''' (ゲドーくん ''Gedō-kun'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hater
|image = E 385.png
|appearance = [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has low health and attack power, medium movement speed, extremely low range, and [[Single Attack]].

==Strategy==
Due to Hater's Single Target and low stats, almost anything should be able to work against it. Use strong [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] to take out a group of them quickly.

